WEBVTT

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.880
I'm glad we saw this movie.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.470
Me, too.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:25.060
I... I like him.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.980
I feel so at ease around him.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.070
Huh?

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:33.570
What's going on?

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:38.740
I have no guarantee a kiss or
anything else will work out, and yet...

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:45.830
Senpai...

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:47.540
Senpai...

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:55.380
If these feelings aren't
the real deal, what is?

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:58.930
Senpai...

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:03.390
I like him so much, my chest feels tight.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.110
Whenever I'm around you,
I can't help but feel that way.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.150
--Mya-chan, wanna grab--
--Senpai, um--

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:17.610
Oh, sorry. You were saying?

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.820
I-It's nothing.

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:29.420
I was going to say that with so
many people around? Am I crazy?

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:30.340
"His heart is pounding like crazy..."

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:33.550
"His heart is pounding like crazy..."
Confessing feelings takes
so much courage...

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.170
"His heart is pounding like crazy..."
And it's only in response...

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:39.720
When do I say it? Hold on, what do I say?

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:42.100
Mya-chan?

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.770
I don't know how to do this!

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:06.500
"Sasaki and Miyano"

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.570
--Let's go to a café. We can
discuss the movie more there.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.240
"What Do I Do With These Feelings?"

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.240
--Let's go to a café. We can
discuss the movie more there.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:23.410
"What Do I Do With These Feelings?"

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:23.410
--Let's go to a café. We can
discuss the movie more there.
--Masato! Sorry I took so long!

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:26.450
I just couldn't decide.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:29.450
Whoa, you okay? What's wrong?

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:33.920
Something I had strong hints
about turned out to be true.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.500
Is it something bad?

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:39.260
No, more like something
that can't be changed.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.590
I was considering how to approach it...

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:44.300
Did I ask for orange juice?

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:50.640
I couldn't decide, so I sorta
got both. Split it with me?

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:51.850
Sure.

00:03:54.190 --> 00:04:00.070
That was a classmate I had no negative
opinion of and a <i>kouhai </i>I was fond of...

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:05.950
I like guys, so forget about grandkids!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:13.160
Two guys together...

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:23.380
Ever since I realized I like him...

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:27.350
Morning, Mya-chan!

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.310
...he's seemed cute to me.

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:36.770
I-It's nothing. Are you going to sit?

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:39.020
Nah, I'm fine.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:43.820
A guy doesn't want another guy
to tell him he looks cute.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:47.200
Here I am thinking about him

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.240
the thing that made me so
uncomfortable in middle school.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:56.290
Besides, Senpai is cool.
He can act even when I hesitate...

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:59.340
Oh, hey. Thanks for lending me this novel.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:02.050
It was easy to read, so I flew through it.

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:04.340
Y-You're welcome. What did you think?

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:09.430
If not for the novel's night-time scene,
I might have forgotten it was BL.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:12.100
Yes, there was only a little at the end.

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:13.270
Yeah.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:15.440
The movie felt really natural.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:18.940
I'm glad I got to see it live-action.

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:22.820
Mya-chan, are you sleepy?
Did you pull another BL all-nighter?

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:25.110
No, I'm fine.

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:28.870
Um, I'm glad you enjoyed it.

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:32.240
Cool. Thanks for lending it to me.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:37.460
Even though all these people are here,
I feel like I might tell him I like him.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:44.130
I keep missing my chance to tell him.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:46.680
It's so hard to find time alone together.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:50.970
We're in different classes and grades,
and we're not on the same committee.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:54.100
We're not alone on the way
to and from school.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.680
But really,

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:59.520
I let it go so long that I don't
know how to bring it up!

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:02.110
I'll do it the next time I see him...

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:04.190
Whatcha doin', Kuresawa?

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:07.240
Deciding how to report
Miyano's range of emotions.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.740
--That's just how he always is.
--Should I say I want to talk
and take him behind the school?

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:12.080
--I got the last bread.
--Should I say I want to talk
and take him behind the school?

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.700
--Bread, huh?
--But that's kinda...

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.370
That reminds me. Miyano.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:18.000
Yeah?

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.500
Sasaki was working in a bakery, right?

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.040
Uh-huh.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.010
What bakery? Is it good?

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.340
Huh, I never went in.

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:29.970
It was on the way to my girlfriend.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.090
I'll have to try it.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.430
I'll go, too!

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:34.350
You won't be seeing my girlfriend.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:36.770
I'm only after the bread!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:46.070
Christmas is almost here again! Listen up!

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.780
"Christmas"

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:53.280
Attention! I plan to throw our first
Christmas party on Christmas!

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.870
That's girlfriend time. Pass.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.120
Dammit!

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.250
You're unshakable, huh?

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:03.670
Now's the time, gents. Non-singles,
raise your hands. You'll be excused.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.210
That's so many!

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:11.630
Where are you meeting all these girls?

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.100
Hmm.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.060
Huh? Where are you looking?

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:20.100
Hold it, mister. What was
that long delay about?

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.190
For real?

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:24.270
I plan to get a girlfriend
before Christmas.

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:28.570
Couples that get together just in time
for Christmas break up immediately.

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:30.030
Drop that idea.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.740
What?

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:36.330
I don't intend for it to be just for
Christmas, but it'd suck to be alone.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:39.500
You won't be alone! We'll all be together!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.750
--I wanna spend it with a girl, though.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.250
--If you get together before
Christmas, you break up?
--I wanna spend it with a girl, though.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.040
--If you get together before
Christmas, you break up?
--I could dress as a girl.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:47.130
--Is that what it would look
like if I answered now?
--Absolutely not. How would that help?

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.840
--Is that what it would look
like if I answered now?
--It's better than being alone, isn't it?

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:52.300
--I don't want to risk that...
--It's better than being alone, isn't it?

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.180
Miyano, raise your hand.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:55.430
Huh? Okay.

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:58.180
"Miyano"

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:58.180
Miyano, too?! Noted.

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:02.770
"Traitors Who Will Be Absent"
"Shirahama, Kuresawa, Odori, Yuhi, Miyano"

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:02.770
--Huh?!
--Dammit! All of you, really?

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.730
Kuresawa, what gives?!

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:06.900
Put it on your calendar anyway.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:10.820
You can still go. This way
you have the option not to.

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:12.150
Really?

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:15.620
That's a lot of traitors!
Some of you are fibbing!

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:21.330
Okay, but Tashiro's face is scaring me.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:24.500
Miyano, don't tell me you
got Kuresawa Syndrome!

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.210
Tashiro, it's to keep his options open.

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:30.460
Otakus have a lot going on.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.340
Oh. Is that all?

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:35.760
I thought he was finally
dating Sasaki-senpai.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:42.480
You aren't fazed, huh, Tashiro?

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:43.600
By what?

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.190
Nevermind.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.520
You're a good guy.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:48.230
You only just noticed?

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.700
Christmas...

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.780
We won't see each other
during winter break.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:59.700
To see him, I'd have to invite him...

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:01.700
Morning, Mya-chan!

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.410
Good morning.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.620
We see each other a lot lately.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:09.960
Entrance exams are soon,
so there's prep in the morning.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.130
We have quizzes every day.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:14.630
Aren't the teachers tired of it?

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:17.590
It wouldn't hurt to just let us
play cards for one day.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:20.260
Must be tough to be in charge of us.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:24.350
Wouldn't that hurt you in the end?

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:28.310
The school is holding special
winter classes that I'll be going to.

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:32.110
But Hirano said he won't be there.
He's going home.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:34.030
He'll take a prep course instead.

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:36.700
I wish I had some of his concentration.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.950
Oh, sorry for just grumbling.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:42.870
You're not grumbling. When are the exams?

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.500
January.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:46.670
Have you picked out your college yet?

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:52.210
Not yet. The teacher told me
to do more research.

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:55.630
If you get in to your target
school, wanna celebrate?

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:58.090
Senpai, we can't skip over you.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:02.260
Oh, yeah. You'll celebrate
with me? If I get in.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:03.180
Of course.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.060
Then let's do our best!

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:11.610
Can I see you on Christmas?

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:17.450
How can I say that?
It would interrupt his studying.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:22.200
He's been giving me all the time I need.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:26.040
How could I just forget
about what he needs?

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:31.460
I'm behind you. Not that
I can do much to help.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:34.340
Thanks. I'm glad.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:37.760
Was it like this for him, too?

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:40.550
A one-year gap is so big.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:45.020
Conveying feelings is so complicated.

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:49.850
Hey, Mya-chan. Do you
have plans on the 25th?

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:51.400
Huh?!

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:54.400
There's an... exhibit?
For the movie we saw.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:59.570
There's art from the novel. And behind
the scenes stuff. That kind of thing.

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.070
Where was it?

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:03.120
Somewhere close to the theater.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:05.120
If you're free, do ya wanna go?

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:08.120
Don't you need to study?

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:10.250
It'll be a little break. Just the exhibit.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:14.290
Come with me. That would help.

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:15.960
I'd love to go.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:17.210
Great.

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:21.720
"Ticket Viewer"
"Exhibit"

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:21.720
Found it.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:24.850
Check it out. I think we
don't need reservations.

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:28.480
Hmm. It says we don't
just to see the exhibit.

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:32.600
That reminds me. I have a CD from
the band that did the theme song.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:33.940
Different songs, though.

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.690
What?! You do?

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.860
I really liked the theme song.

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:40.400
Wanna borrow it?

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.700
--Thank goodness...
--Can I?

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:45.160
Sure. I'll bring it next time.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:47.040
Thank you.

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:50.330
...that we're on the train and in public.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:54.420
Miyano!

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.090
Chairman!

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:59.340
I mean, Hanzawa-senpai.

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:00.840
It's been a while.

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:04.340
I think we last spoke
at the cultural festival.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.350
Masato.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:10.180
The clerk says ten more minutes.

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:12.230
My big brother. A <i>kouhai</i>.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:13.350
Hello there.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.610
Oh, hello.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:19.070
Our parents sent us out
to get stuff for Christmas.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:22.070
Awful, right? I need to be studying.

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:27.280
Ma-kun, you just wanted to use that
excuse to sneak in time with your friends.

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:29.660
Oops.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:32.000
Hey, we're in public.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.920
Sorry.

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:35.380
Ma-kun...

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.500
See? He latched on.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:41.460
Miyano, your homework
over the break is to forget.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:42.590
Got that?

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:45.430
Don't worry. I'm forgetful.

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:48.220
Not a reassuring answer.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.180
Are you Masato's boyfriend, by chance?

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:51.020
What?!

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:54.810
He's not. I swear you're incorrigible.

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.110
But you look so happy, Masato.

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:59.900
Did you know that,
in middle school, Masato--

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:01.940
Hey!

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:05.820
I hate how you try to connect
everything to romance.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.910
Sorry.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:14.960
The clerk might be ready now. I'll go ask.

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:18.080
Okay.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.550
Sorry about that.

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:24.010
He just loves talking about
love and romance.

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:27.510
I seem to remember you
talking about that a lot, too.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:34.020
I once saw Sasaki-senpai
with his big sister.

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.890
They seemed close.

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:39.900
I don't have any siblings,
so it was fun to see.

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.740
So you're a younger brother, too.

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:48.740
And what do you mean by that, Miyano?

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:50.870
My head is off-limits today.

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:58.460
You can't just let
anybody touch your head.

00:13:58.460 --> 00:13:59.960
Huh?

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:04.210
Your head is at perfect
patting height to begin with.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:06.170
But you've gotten taller.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.510
Last year you barely
came up past my waist.

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:10.930
Oh, come on. That's ridiculous!

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:12.810
Did you break 5'7''?

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.230
I'm still working on it.

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:17.390
You might before the end of high school.

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:18.900
You think so?

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.860
Oh, are you okay on time?

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:24.820
I'd better get going. Good to see you.

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:27.820
You, too. Take care.

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.860
He left?

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:30.950
Yeah.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:33.790
I'm sorry.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.040
What for?

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:39.500
I hadn't seen you that happy
in a while, so I teased you.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:45.800
It's fine. But my <i>kouhai </i>has somebody,
so don't drag him into it.

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:48.840
O-Okay. I won't.

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:50.590
Is there anything left to get?

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:52.180
Just the chicken.

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:58.600
So you <i>don't </i>have feelings for him.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:14:59.890
Thin ice.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:02.190
S-Sorry.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:06.820
It's just, you're close to people,
but you never date them.

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:10.780
Is it because of us?

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:14.370
If you need me to,
I'll talk to Mom and Dad...

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:19.790
Are you under the impression I like guys?

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.080
What? You don't?

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:24.040
I don't. My attraction is to girls.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:29.260
Then what's the deal? You hang out with
girls, but you're not dating any of them.

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:32.050
Right now I'm enjoying
hanging out with friends.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.260
Oh, I see!

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:36.180
I had a period like that, too.

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:38.310
Okay. Makes sense.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:42.520
I'm sorry, too. For being harsh.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.060
What?

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:48.320
I don't think there's anything
wrong with your love.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:49.360
I know.

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:54.320
I'm glad I have you for a brother, Ma-kun.

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:58.790
Hey, Mom. I like guys,
so forget about grandkids!

00:15:58.790 --> 00:15:59.620
What?!

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.710
What? Was that a... coming out?

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:04.460
Whoa. Really?

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:06.040
Me, too! Me, too! I think.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:06.880
What?

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:09.800
Oh. Welcome to the club.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.680
What about you?

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:15.260
I... like girls...

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:16.850
Okay.

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:21.600
Then Masato will give me grandchildren,
so you can do what you want.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:23.810
Yay! So understanding!

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:26.610
Okay, now eat your dinner!

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:29.070
--Man, I was kinda nervous.
--I'm glad it wasn't just me.
--I want a boyfriend, too.

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.990
How come mom sounded relieved?

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:39.330
You don't need to be so worried, Mom.

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:43.330
I was taken aback at first,

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:48.920
but looking back, those two
always looked excited together.

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:53.760
--I just don't want you
to fall for a bad guy.
--It makes me believe
my brothers will be okay.

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:57.430
I'll have to find a guy
who passes your test.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:02.640
Because those two looked happy.

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.950
"Happy New Year"

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:16.950
"Huge Sale"

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:25.460
"Thursday, Jan. 6th."
Miyano, morning!

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:27.130
"Thursday, Jan. 6th."
Morning!

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.210
Goin' somewhere?

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.920
The seniors'--

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:32.630
They supposedly have a test.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:38.390
Sasaki-senpai, um...

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:41.350
Sasaki, the teacher wants you.

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:44.060
I'll come by later. Sorry.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.520
Senpai, I...

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.230
Miyano.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:48.980
--Senpa--
--Sasaki!

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:52.280
Senpai, I...

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:53.530
Miyano!

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:57.700
--Senpa--
--Sasaki!

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:59.370
Senpai!

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:00.700
Senpa--

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:01.830
Senp--

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:04.830
Sorry. Another time.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.170
--Okay...
--Come on, let's go.

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:09.330
I can't get him alone.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:17.760
Mya-chan, let's leave together today.

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:18.890
Okay.

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:22.640
Uh, a-also, I need
to talk about something.

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:25.640
Oh? Okay. Will after school work?

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:27.100
Y-Yes.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.140
Got it.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:34.940
It's the new year, so I'm past
the Christmas breakup window.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:41.570
I'll get off at Senpai's station. Then
I'll take him aside to an empty alley.

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:44.540
No, I'll seem suspicious.

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.710
I feel like I've seen
the alley thing in BL.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:52.420
I'll go home immediately afterwards,
so I don't distract from his studies...

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:59.130
It's today.

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:00.640
I'm telling him today.

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:03.640
I'm ready now.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:06.810
Thanks for lending me this CD.

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:08.350
You're done with it?

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:11.270
I had it for the whole winter break.

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:15.230
I was surprised this band
did a BL theme song.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.740
Most of their stuff isn't love songs.

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:20.950
Yeah. I was surprised at first, too.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:23.580
But I liked a lot of the songs.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:25.790
My mom even knew one.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.120
I see.

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:30.120
I'm glad you seem to like this band.

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.790
I-I do.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:37.460
He's always so direct. It makes me blush.

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:39.800
I want to be that way, too.

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:49.020
Hey, I noticed you always move
your bag to the other shoulder.

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:49.890
What?!

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:51.140
How come?

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:58.190
Well, um...

00:19:58.190 --> 00:20:01.150
...it's...

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:05.450
...so I don't hit you with my bag...

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:13.580
So that's why. So cute.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.840
Please just forget I said that.

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.420
Do you do that for everybody?

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:18.880
Of course not!

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:21.470
I don't usually walk next to people.

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:27.220
And you always walk on the left,
so now it's a habit...

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:29.220
--How long?
--Do I?

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:39.900
The whole time...

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:45.030
Miyano-senpai! The Chairman
was looking for you.

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:48.030
The new one. Not Hanzawa-senpai.

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.540
We'll be waiting for you.

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:52.830
--Why today, of all days?
--Uh, o-okay.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.870
I never noticed...

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:58.210
...how much he considers me.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:05.890
Senpai, I'm sorry, but could
you wait by the entr...

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:07.600
...ance...

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:13.890
I like him so much.

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:17.360
What do I do about these feelings?

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:26.360
Sorry.

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:27.490
What?!

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:30.120
No, it's... um, I...

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.830
I, uh...

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.920
So long, sir.

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.960
Don't slack just because
you don't have to come to class.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:45.010
--Don't add to the pressure!
--Let's go to a candy store.

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:48.720
--You're almost there. I'll treat you
to <i>yakinuku </i>when it's over.
--I'm broke right now.
I only have 130 yen.

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:51.720
--You always say that.
--There's no tax,
so you can get 13 candies.

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:55.270
--If not <i>yakiniku</i>, how about sushi?
--How can that be?

00:21:55.270 --> 00:22:00.020
Oh, right. I'm still at school,

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:07.280
and Senpai was about to kiss me...

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:09.410
Sorry. I'll head home.

00:22:09.410 --> 00:22:10.700
What?!

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:12.450
Senpai, wai--

00:23:45.380 --> 00:23:47.340
"Episode 12: 'Just Beginning.'"
